{
  "title": "Ziyarat e Hazrat Rasul e Khuda",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا رَسُوْلَ اﷲِ وَرَحْمَۃُ اﷲِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nalssalamu `alayka ya rasula allahi wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nPeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah, and Allah’s mercy and blessings.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَامُحَمَّدُ ابْنَ عَبْدِ اﷲِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammadu bna `abdi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O Muhammad, son of `Abdullah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خِیَرَۃَ اﷲِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya khiyarata allahi\npeace be upon you, O the chosen one of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَبِیْبَ اﷲِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya habiba allahi\npeace be upon you, O the beloved of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَفْوَۃَ اﷲِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya safwata allahi\npeace be upon you, O the pure elite of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَااَمِیْنَ اﷲِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya amina allahi\npeace be upon you, O the trustee of Allah.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ رَسُوْلُ اﷲِ\nashhadu annaka rasulu allahi\nI bear witness that you are the Messenger of Allah,\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ مُحَمَّدُ ابْنُ عَبْدِ اﷲِ\nwa ashhadu annaka muhammadu bnu `abdi allahi\nand I bear witness that you are Muhammad, the son of `Abdullah,\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْنَصَحْتَ لِاَمَّتِكَ\nwa ashhadu annaka qad nasahta li'ummatika\nand I bear witness that you sincerely advised your nation,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ رَبِّكَ\nwa jahadta fi sabili rabbika\nand you strove in the way of your Lord,\nوَعَبَدْتَّهٗ حَتّٰی اَتَاكَ الْیَقِیْنُ\nwa `abadtahu hatta ataka alyaqinu\nand you worshipped Him until certainty (death) came to you;\nفَجَزَاكَ اﷲُ یَا رَسُوْلَ اﷲِ اَفْضَلَ مَا جَزیٰ نَبِیًّا عَنْ اُمَّتِهٖ۔\nfajazaka allahu ya rasula allahi afdala ma jaza nabiyyan `an ummatihi\nso may Allah reward you, O Messenger of Allah, with the best reward He has ever given a Prophet on behalf of his nation.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلیٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nallahumma salli `ala muhammadin wa ali muhammadin\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad,\nكَاَفْضَلِ مَا صَلَّیْتَ عَلیٰ اِبْرَاهِیْمَ وَاٰلِ اِبْرَاهِیْمَ\nka'afdali ma sallayta `ala ibrahima wa ali ibrahima\nthe best of what You sent upon Ibrahim and the family of Ibrahim;\nاِنَّكَ حَمِیْدٌ مَّجِیْدٌ۔\ninnaka hamidun majidun\nindeed You are Praiseworthy, Glorious."
}
